  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova: Supporting Moldova&#x2019;s Independent Anti-Corruption Advisory Committee (CCIA) &#x2013; Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To create evidence base for sector-specific anti-corruption legislative and regulatory advocacy. 2) To enable operations and activities of the Independent Anti-Corruption Advisory Committee (CCIA).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: Independent Anti-Corruption Advisory Committee (CCIA). Indirect beneficiaries: Population and institutions of Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aimed to continue strengthening Moldova&apos;s capacity for more inclusive and accountable governance through implementation of sector-specific anti-corruption legislative and regulatory reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
